<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" data-theme="{{ '' }}">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ title }} — {{ generated_kst }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    --plane:#f9f9f7; --surface-1:#fcfcfb;
    --text-primary:#0b0b0b; --text-secondary:#52514e; --muted:#898781;
    --grid:#e1e0d9; --baseline:#c3c2b7; --border:rgba(11,11,11,0.10);
    --track:#e1e0d9; --track-strong:#c3c2b7; --spark-fill:rgba(42,120,214,0.10);
    --series-1:#2a78d6; --series-2:#eb6834; --series-3:#1baf7a; --series-4:#eda100;
    --series-5:#e87ba4; --series-6:#008300; --series-7:#4a3aa7; --series-8:#e34948;
    --seq-350:#5598e7; --seq-450:#2a78d6;
    --good:#0ca30c; --warning:#fab219; --serious:#ec835a; --critical:#d03b3b;
    --up:#006300; --down:#d03b3b;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:where(:not([data-theme="light"])) {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --plane:#0d0d0d; --surface-1:#1a1a19;
      --text-primary:#ffffff; --text-secondary:#c3c2b7; --muted:#898781;
      --grid:#2c2c2a; --baseline:#383835; --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
      --track:#2c2c2a; --track-strong:#4a4a46; --spark-fill:rgba(57,135,229,0.14);
      --series-1:#3987e5; --series-2:#d95926; --series-3:#199e70; --series-4:#c98500;
      --series-5:#d55181; --series-6:#008300; --series-7:#9085e9; --series-8:#e66767;
      --seq-350:#5598e7; --seq-450:#3987e5;
      --up:#0ca30c; --down:#d03b3b;
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] {
    color-scheme: dark;
    --plane:#0d0d0d; --surface-1:#1a1a19;
    --text-primary:#ffffff; --text-secondary:#c3c2b7; --muted:#898781;
    --grid:#2c2c2a; --baseline:#383835; --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
    --track:#2c2c2a; --track-strong:#4a4a46; --spark-fill:rgba(57,135,229,0.14);
    --series-1:#3987e5; --series-2:#d95926; --series-3:#199e70; --series-4:#c98500;
    --series-5:#d55181; --series-6:#008300; --series-7:#9085e9; --series-8:#e66767;
    --seq-350:#5598e7; --seq-450:#3987e5;
    --up:#0ca30c; --down:#d03b3b;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin:0; padding:28px 20px 64px;
    background:var(--plane); color:var(--text-primary);
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", sans-serif;
    font-size:14px; line-height:1.5;
  }
  .wrap { max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; }
  header { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; margin-bottom:22px; }
  h1 { font-size:19px; margin:0 0 2px; letter-spacing:-0.01em; }
  .sub { color:var(--muted); font-size:12.5px; }
  .theme-btn {
    background:var(--surface-1); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--text-secondary);
    border-radius:8px; padding:6px 11px; font-size:12.5px; cursor:pointer; font-family:inherit;
  }
  .card {
    background:var(--surface-1); border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:14px; padding:20px 22px; margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  h2 { font-size:12px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.07em;
       color:var(--muted); margin:0 0 14px; font-weight:600; }

  .hero-val { font-size:48px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-0.02em; line-height:1.05; }
  .hero-row { display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .kpis { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(155px,1fr)); gap:14px; margin-top:20px; }
  .kpi-l { color:var(--muted); font-size:11.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em; }
  .kpi-v { font-size:22px; font-weight:600; margin-top:3px; letter-spacing:-0.01em; }

  .up { color:var(--up); } .down { color:var(--down); }
  .delta { font-size:14px; font-weight:600; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }

  table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
  th { text-align:right; font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em;
       color:var(--muted); font-weight:600; padding:0 0 9px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--grid); }
  th:first-child, td:first-child { text-align:left; }
  td { padding:10px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--grid); text-align:right; }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom:none; }
  td.tk { font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.01em; }
  .spark, .meter { display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; }
  td.c, th.c { text-align:center; }
  .muted { color:var(--muted); }
  .sec { color:var(--text-secondary); }

  .alert { display:flex; gap:11px; align-items:flex-start; padding:11px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--grid); }
  .alert:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
  .dot { width:9px; height:9px; border-radius:50%; margin-top:6px; flex:none; }
  .badge { font-size:10.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.05em; text-transform:uppercase;
           padding:2px 7px; border-radius:5px; border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--text-secondary); flex:none; }
  .s-good .dot{background:var(--good);} .s-warning .dot{background:var(--warning);}
  .s-serious .dot{background:var(--serious);} .s-critical .dot{background:var(--critical);}

  .legend { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:14px; margin-top:12px; }
  .lg { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-secondary); }
  .sw { width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:3px; flex:none; }
  .wbar { display:flex; gap:2px; height:34px; }
  .seg { border-radius:4px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
         color:#fff; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; overflow:hidden; white-space:nowrap;
         text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
  .seg:first-child { border-radius:8px 4px 4px 8px; }
  .seg:last-child  { border-radius:4px 8px 8px 4px; }
  .axis { fill:var(--muted); font-size:11px; font-family:system-ui,sans-serif; }
  .series-label { fill:var(--text-secondary); font-size:12px; font-weight:600; font-family:system-ui,sans-serif; }
  footer { color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; text-align:center; margin-top:26px; line-height:1.7; }
  @media (max-width:640px){
    .hide-sm { display:none; }
    .hero-val { font-size:38px; }
    body { padding:18px 12px 48px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<header>
  <div>
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <div class="sub">{{ generated_kst }} 기준 · 종가 {{ last_close_date }} · 종목 {{ stats|length }}개</div>
  </div>
  <button class="theme-btn" id="tt" type="button">다크 / 라이트</button>
</header>

{% if portfolio.has_holdings and not public_dashboard %}
<section class="card">
  <h2>포트폴리오</h2>
  <div class="hero-row">
    <div class="hero-val">${{ '{:,.0f}'.format(portfolio.total) }}</div>
    <div class="delta {{ 'up' if portfolio.day_pnl >= 0 else 'down' }}">
      {{ '▲' if portfolio.day_pnl >= 0 else '▼' }}
      ${{ '{:,.0f}'.format(portfolio.day_pnl|abs) }} ({{ '{:+.2f}'.format(portfolio.day_pct) }}%) 오늘
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="kpis">
    <div><div class="kpi-l">평가손익</div>
      <div class="kpi-v {{ 'up' if portfolio.pnl >= 0 else 'down' }}">{{ '{:+,.0f}'.format(portfolio.pnl) }}</div></div>
    <div><div class="kpi-l">수익률</div>
      <div class="kpi-v {{ 'up' if portfolio.pnl_pct >= 0 else 'down' }}">{{ '{:+.2f}'.format(portfolio.pnl_pct) }}%</div></div>
    <div><div class="kpi-l">주식 평가액</div>
      <div class="kpi-v">${{ '{:,.0f}'.format(portfolio.equity) }}</div></div>
    <div><div class="kpi-l">현금 비중</div>
      <div class="kpi-v">{{ '{:.1f}'.format(portfolio.cash_weight) }}%</div></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:24px">{{ weight_bar|safe }}</div>
  <div class="legend">
    {% for r in portfolio.rows %}
      <span class="lg"><span class="sw" style="background:var(--series-{{ loop.index0 % 8 + 1 }})"></span>{{ r.ticker }} {{ '{:.1f}'.format(r.weight) }}%</span>
    {% endfor %}
    <span class="lg"><span class="sw" style="background:var(--track-strong)"></span>현금 {{ '{:.1f}'.format(portfolio.cash_weight) }}%</span>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top:20px">
    <thead><tr>
      <th>종목</th><th class="hide-sm">수량</th><th class="hide-sm">평단</th><th>현재가</th>
      <th>평가액</th><th>수익률</th><th>오늘</th>
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for r in portfolio.rows %}
      <tr>
        <td class="tk">{{ r.ticker }}</td>
        <td class="hide-sm sec">{{ '{:g}'.format(r.shares) }}</td>
        <td class="hide-sm sec">${{ '{:,.2f}'.format(r.avg_price) }}</td>
        <td>${{ '{:,.2f}'.format(r.price) }}</td>
        <td>${{ '{:,.0f}'.format(r.value) }}</td>
        <td class="{{ 'up' if r.pnl_pct >= 0 else 'down' }}">{{ '{:+.2f}'.format(r.pnl_pct) }}%</td>
        <td class="{{ 'up' if r.day_pct >= 0 else 'down' }}">{{ '{:+.2f}'.format(r.day_pct) }}%</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="card">
  <h2>알림 {% if fired %}({{ fired|length }}){% endif %}</h2>
  {% if fired %}
    {% for a in fired %}
      <div class="alert s-{{ a.severity }}">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        <span class="badge">{{ a.severity }}</span>
        <span>{{ a.message }}</span>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
    <div class="muted">조건에 걸린 종목이 없습니다.</div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="card">
  <h2>워치리스트</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr>
      <th>종목</th><th>종가</th><th>1일</th><th>5일</th><th class="hide-sm">20일</th>
      <th class="hide-sm">RSI</th><th class="hide-sm">200일선</th>
      <th class="c hide-sm" style="width:150px">52주 위치</th>
      <th class="c" style="width:150px">최근 {{ sparkline_days }}일</th>
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for row in stats %}
      <tr>
        <td class="tk">{{ row.ticker }}</td>
        <td>${{ '{:,.2f}'.format(row.close) }}</td>
        <td class="{{ 'up' if row.chg_1d >= 0 else 'down' }}">{{ '{:+.2f}'.format(row.chg_1d) }}%</td>
        <td class="{{ 'up' if row.chg_5d >= 0 else 'down' }}">{{ '{:+.2f}'.format(row.chg_5d) }}%</td>
        <td class="hide-sm {{ 'up' if row.chg_20d >= 0 else 'down' }}">{{ '{:+.2f}'.format(row.chg_20d) }}%</td>
        <td class="hide-sm sec">{{ '{:.0f}'.format(row.rsi) }}</td>
        <td class="hide-sm sec">{{ '위' if row.above_sma200 else '아래' if row.above_sma200 is not none else '—' }}</td>
        <td class="c hide-sm">{{ row.meter|safe }}</td>
        <td class="c">{{ row.spark|safe }}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<footer>
  GitHub Actions 로 자동 생성 · 데이터 출처 Yahoo Finance<br>
  투자 판단의 근거가 아니라 개인 기록용 지표 요약입니다.
</footer>
</div>

<script>
  (function () {
    var btn = document.getElementById('tt'), root = document.documentElement;
    try { var s = localStorage.getItem('theme'); if (s) root.setAttribute('data-theme', s); } catch (e) {}
    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var dark = root.getAttribute('data-theme') === 'dark'
        || (!root.getAttribute('data-theme') && matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches);
      var next = dark ? 'light' : 'dark';
      root.setAttribute('data-theme', next);
      try { localStorage.setItem('theme', next); } catch (e) {}
    });
  })();
</script>
</body>
</html>
